  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## One Change at a Time\r\n\r\nBig requests (\"redesign the whole page!\") give AI room to surprise you - and not always in a good way. Skilled collaborators work in **small steps**, checking each one.\r\n\r\nHere's a plain page about famous artworks. Make it great, one step at a time.\r\n\r\n**Do This:** Improve this page with **three separate requests** - judge and Accept (or Reject) each one before making the next:\r\n1. One change to how the page **looks** (colors, style, mood...)\r\n2. One change to the **content** (add a fact, a new artwork, a better title...)\r\n3. One change of **your choice**.\r\n\r\n> **Notice:** After each change, everything you already approved stays put. Small steps mean small surprises.\r\n\r\nOnce you've accepted three changes, click **Continue**.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
    "widget_view": "false",
