        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <style>\n      img {\n        border: 10px solid #8888ff;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Famous Works of Art</h1>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>The Starry Night</h2>\n      <img src=\"starry-night.jpg\" alt=\"The Starry Night by Vincent van Gogh\">\n      <p><em>Vincent van Gogh, 1889</em></p>\n      <p>A swirling night sky over a quiet village, painted while Van Gogh was staying at a psychiatric hospital in France.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Girl with a Pearl Earring</h2>\n      <img src=\"girl-with-pearl-earring.jpg\" alt=\"Girl with a Pearl Earring by Johannes Vermeer\">\n      <p><em>Johannes Vermeer, 1665</em></p>\n      <p>Often called the \"Mona Lisa of the North,\" this painting is known for its subject's direct and mysterious gaze.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>The Great Wave</h2>\n      <img src=\"great-wave.jpg\" alt=\"The Great Wave off Kanagawa by Katsushika Hokusai\">\n      <p><em>Katsushika Hokusai, 1831</em></p>\n      <p>One of the most recognizable works in Japanese art, depicting a towering wave with Mount Fuji in the background.</p>\n    </section>\n\t\n\t<footer>\n\t\t<p>Image credit: All images from Wikimedia Creative Commons</p>\n\t</footer>\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
